need taurine if they eat complete food?","answer":"<p>Complete commercial foods are formulated to meet established nutritional requirements when fed as directed. Some cat parents still choose a measured taurine supplement for added consistency, especially when meals are not always finished or the diet includes homemade or raw food. Speak with your veterinarian before changing your cat's nutrition plan.<\/p>"}},"faq_g4VHpy":{"type":"faq","settings":{"category":"product","question":"Will my cat notice it in their food?","answer":"<p>SuperTaurine is designed to mix easily into food. For especially selective cats, begin with a smaller amount and increase gradually while mixing it thoroughly into a familiar meal.<\/p>"}},"faq_7ae3tg":{"type":"faq","settings":{"category":"product","question":"How should SuperTaurine be stored?","answer":"<p>Keep the tub tightly closed in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight, moisture and heat. Always use a clean, dry scoop.<\/p>"}},"faq_cFCF4j":{"type":"faq","settings":{"category":"product","question":"Can it be used with other supplements or medication?","answer":"<p>If your cat takes another supplement, prescription medication or has a diagnosed medical condition, check with your veterinarian before adding SuperTaurine.<\/p>"}},"faq_HbKnre":{"type":"faq","settings":{"category":"product","question":"Can I give it to a pregnant or nursing cat?","answer":"<p>Ask your veterinarian before giving any new supplement to a pregnant or nursing cat.<\/p>"}},"faq_tkebPc":{"type":"faq","settings":{"category":"product","question":"What should I do if my cat consumes too much?","answer":"<p>Stop serving the supplement and contact your veterinarian or an animal poison-control service for guidance. Keep the tub available so you can provide the ingredient and serving information.<\/p>"}},"faq_GQEdT6":{"type":"faq","settings":{"category":"general","question":"Where can I manage my subscription?","answer":"<p>Use the subscription-management link sent to the email address associated with your order. If you cannot find it, check your spam folder or contact Meowgical support.<\/p>"}},"faq_HWaxDR":{"type":"faq","settings":{"category":"general","question":"How long does order processing take?","answer":"<p>Your current processing and estimated delivery times are shown at checkout and in your order-confirmation email. Tracking details are emailed once your package is on the way.<\/p>"}},"faq_CDTFHQ":{"type":"faq","settings":{"category":"general","question":"How do I track my order?","answer":"<p>Once your order ships, you will receive a tracking email. Use the tracking link in that message to view the latest carrier updates.<\/p>"}},"faq_yAqbAJ":{"type":"faq","settings":{"category":"general","question":"What is the 60-day guarantee?","answer":"<p>Try SuperTaurine for up to 60 days. If it is not right for you and your cat, contact our support team within the guarantee period for help with your refund request. Any eligibility terms shown in our refund policy apply.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["faq_DMVA87","faq_WB6kxk","faq_4xzU7A","faq_mX6ePh","faq_g4VHpy","faq_7ae3tg","faq_cFCF4j","faq_HbKnre","faq_tkebPc","faq_GQEdT6","faq_HWaxDR","faq_CDTFHQ","faq_yAqbAJ"],"name":"Meowgical FAQs","settings":{"eyebrow":"Need help?","heading":"FAQ","subheading":"<p>Everything you need to know before getting started.<\/p>","heading_alignment_mobile":"center","heading_alignment_desktop":"center","show_tabs":true,"product_tab_label":"SUPERTAURINE","general_tab_label":"FAQS?","only_one_open":true,"enable_faq_schema":true,"button_text":"PROTECT MY CAT TODAY","button_link":"#product","guarantee_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_20_2026_08_30_25_PM.png","guarantee_text":"90-day risk-free guarantee","button_use_gradient":true,"button_gradient_1":"#3e50dc","button_gradient_2":"#44d6fa","button_gradient_angle":135,"button_bg":"#3e50dc","button_border_color":"#173fae","button_border_width":1,"button_radius":100,"button_width_mobile"